@Wenjing
The English-only teaching environment seemed scary at first, but I can keep up with sufficient preparation. The general learning atmosphere on campus is also highly motivating.  

@Lulu
The professors are nice and patient and encourage us to participate in discussions actively in English. The small-sized classes allow us to engage more and improve faster. 

@Liming
I had no idea about Moodle when I was in high school. But dealing with Moodle and deadlines has now become part of my daily routine. 


