@Xi
My classmates are not hard to approach, as I feared, but they are easy-going. 

@Zhang
I thought that my roommates would be distant and even indifferent, but a game like Werewolf quickly brought us together.  

@Ding
What impresses me the most is that everyone in the University is well-behaved and trusts one another.  


