@A’ze
Different clubs have different interview procedures and there are several rounds. These are precious opportunities for those of us who barely had any club experience before. 

@Xiaoyuzhou
I want to thank our lovely senior students! They stayed up late to help with our tasks and bought us drinks and snacks.   

@Yitiaoyu
The seniors are friendly, yet the recruitment is a serious thing.
@Zhangzhangzi: I got cold feet when I saw the interview task but I managed to handle it with my group. Working together is productive and I made some awesome friends. 

@Aicaojun
The recruitment process was EXHAUSTING but rewarding. Everyone worked hard to prepare for the presentation, and we watched the sunrise over Nottingham river together afterwards. 


