@Lange
The library is incredible, especially the Lego Lab. 

@Duxiao
The free gym is amazing. It is very convenient and has all sorts of equipment. 

@Sansan
Nice dormitory, delicious food in the canteens, and even a flower store. We often spot professors at Starbucks. 


