@Lu
There are numerous opportunities to socialise at university, such as an icebreaking game.

@Chen
I receive much more messages every day after joining the student club or organisation. It reminds me that I am now part of UNNC’s social network.

@Wan
I became more independent from my family. My new friends and I help each other out, which makes me feel warm.    

